    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "机械共振引起大位移的一个实例发生在韩国首尔的一座 39 层商场中。在 12 楼约二十人进行 Tae Bo 健身操锻炼后，大楼晃动了 10 分钟，导致人员被疏散了两天。专家组得出的结论是，剧烈运动很可能引发了大楼的机械共振。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "An example of how mechanical resonance can cause large displacements occurred in a 39-story shopping mall in Seoul, Korea. After a Tae Bo workout session on the 12th floor with about twenty participants, the building shook for 10 minutes triggering an evacuation for two days. A team of experts concluded that the building was likely excited to mechanical resonance by the vigorous exercise.",
